<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT-Central Pattana rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Central Pattana rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seamico Securities recommended on Friday that investors buy Central Pattana Plc stocks because of its strong recurring cash flow from its Bangkok projects and an estimated 14 percent earnings growth in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;According to CPN management, 4Q 96 earnings growth was fuelled by an increase in occupancy levels at Central Plaza Lat Phrao (in Bangkok) and Central Festival Center Pattaya (in southeast Pattaya resort),&quot; Seamico said in a research report.</p>
</text>
